        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG405-355-630, 14\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe SIG405-355 is a clean, contemporary ladder style door pull handle made of stainless steel by AHI Hardware. It is for use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. The Satin Stainless Steel finish requires little maintenance; and was designed to enhance any high-traffic area. This 14\" contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4\" round pull handle. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-D9000AC-specifications.gif?v=1704354680\" width=\"456\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG405-355 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-610-630\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/36-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-914-630\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/48-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull-ahi-sig405-1220-630\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG405-355-630 Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Height: 14\" (355 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 6\" (152 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\" (76 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (27 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG405-355-sin-specifications.pdf?v=1691093353\"><b>AHI SIG405-355 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull, AHI SIG405-355-630",
                "description": "AHI SIG405-355 door pulls. These 14 inch contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4 inch round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal, fiberglass, or glass doors.  Clean, Contemporary design for use on residential and commercial doors. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired. ",
                "keywords": "AHI-SIG405-355-630 14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Door Pulls, 14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pulls, AHI SIG405-355-630 Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pulls, AHI SIG405-355 door pulls, 14 inch commercial door pulls, storefront door pulls, storefront stainless door pulls, stainless storefront door pulls, IHOP, AHI-SIG405-400-630 door pulls,"
